OL,3,GNEWSA'Marriage is a lot of work,' says
OL,4,AMichael Douglas on 2013 split with
OL,5,ACatherine Zeta-Jones
OL,6,
OL,7,FHollywood star Michael Douglas says his
OL,8,Fmarriage to Welsh actor Catherine
OL,9,FZeta-Jones is "in good shape", as he
OL,10,Freflects on their nearly 30-year
OL,11,Frelationship.
OL,13,FIn an interview with the Sunday Times,
OL,14,FDouglas recalled meeting Zeta-Jones,
OL,15,Fwhen he was 53 and she was 28, at the
OL,16,F1998 Deauville film festival, and
OL,17,Ftelling her: "I'm going to be the
OL,18,Ffather of your children."
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
