OL,3,GNEWSA'Marriage is a lot of work,' says
OL,4,AMichael Douglas on 2013 split with
OL,5,ACatherine Zeta-Jones
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Oscar-winning couple were married
OL,8,Fat a star-studded ceremony at the Plaza
OL,9,FHotel in New York in 2000 and share two
OL,10,Fchildren, Dylan, now 26, and Carys, 23.
OL,12,FThey separated briefly in 2013, but
OL,13,FDouglas, star of hit 1980s films such
OL,14,Fas Wall Street and Fatal Attraction,
OL,15,Fclaimed he "never gave up hope that we
OL,16,Fwould reconcile".
